WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.000
Not every AI use case has the same risk.

00:00:03.220 --> 00:00:12.580
A tool that summarizes public marketing text is different from a system that influences hiring, medical decisions, financial access, security actions, or legal outcomes.

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:14.560
Governance should be proportional.

00:00:14.780 --> 00:00:22.140
Higher-risk uses may require stronger review, documentation, testing, approvals, monitoring, and human oversight.

00:00:22.360 --> 00:00:28.200
Lower-risk uses may need lighter controls, but they still benefit from clear ownership and reasonable boundaries.

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:30.580
The goal is matching oversight to impact.

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:36.560
Proportional governance helps teams move quickly where risk is low and slow down where consequences are significant.
